WEBVTT

01:29.340 --> 01:34.430
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.820 --> 01:38.000
[Episode 21]

01:43.920 --> 01:44.600
Is it good?

01:46.610 --> 01:47.680
I thought

01:47.680 --> 01:50.370
I wouldn't be back in Pingchuan
until the end of the year.

01:50.370 --> 01:51.930
I didn't expect

01:51.930 --> 01:53.240
to get Lan Yue's offer so soon.

01:53.240 --> 01:54.240
Your project's become something

01:54.240 --> 01:55.759
of a gold standard in the industry.

01:55.759 --> 01:58.160
I've even heard a lot about it
in Pingchuan.

02:00.170 --> 02:01.450
I guess Lan Yue's headquarters

02:01.450 --> 02:03.710
didn't want to miss out a talent
like you.

02:04.090 --> 02:06.010
Once I've settled in at Lan Yue,

02:06.320 --> 02:08.720
if you ever need anything,
just let me know.

02:09.199 --> 02:11.250
Then I'd better work harder
and catch up to you.

02:11.250 --> 02:11.960
I don't want to give you

02:11.960 --> 02:13.690
the chance to bail me out.

02:17.040 --> 02:19.840
You've liked competing with me
since we were kids.

02:20.520 --> 02:22.250
Why are you still like this now?

02:22.890 --> 02:24.690
You were always at the top of the class.
I was right behind you.

02:24.690 --> 02:28.490
If I wasn't trying to catch up with you,
who else would I compete with?

02:40.360 --> 02:42.020
Remember back in high school,

02:42.600 --> 02:44.530
when you asked me what my dream was?

02:44.640 --> 02:46.890
I said I wanted to make something
of myself.

02:46.890 --> 02:47.730
I remember.

02:48.760 --> 02:50.160
That's when I told myself

02:50.800 --> 02:52.400
that if I ever had the chance,

02:52.850 --> 02:53.850
I'd bring you to a place like this

02:53.850 --> 02:55.410
for dinner.

02:59.480 --> 03:01.010
Now it's finally come true.

03:02.600 --> 03:05.460
Back then, I never imagined
I'd actually be able to.

03:07.320 --> 03:08.920
Thanks to you, I finally did.

03:16.640 --> 03:17.970
Is everyone doing okay?

03:21.640 --> 03:22.730
Speaking of which,

03:24.890 --> 03:26.010
Ms. Zhang passed away

03:26.010 --> 03:27.470
from an illness recently.

03:28.250 --> 03:30.310
Meng and I just attended her funeral.

03:38.320 --> 03:39.010
I didn't even make it in time

03:39.010 --> 03:40.250
to say goodbye to her.

03:45.690 --> 03:46.950
Are you free tomorrow?

03:48.320 --> 03:49.920
You're not even jet-lagged?

03:54.690 --> 03:56.490
I know exactly what you're up to.

04:03.850 --> 04:04.570
Sir,

04:04.920 --> 04:06.200
when you handle these paintings,

04:06.200 --> 04:07.040
please be gentle.

04:07.040 --> 04:07.760
Be careful.

04:07.760 --> 04:09.570
Don't bump the corners.

04:10.730 --> 04:12.790
These paintings are very expensive.

04:13.520 --> 04:14.360
Be careful.

04:16.079 --> 04:16.690
Go!

04:17.490 --> 04:18.690
Don't run around here, okay?

04:18.690 --> 04:20.010
Don't knock those paintings over.

04:20.010 --> 04:21.339
Go play somewhere else.

04:21.490 --> 04:22.250
Slow down, sir.

04:22.250 --> 04:23.030
Take it slow.

04:23.370 --> 04:25.160
How is it? Not bad, right?

04:27.250 --> 04:29.400
All the furniture is exactly

04:29.400 --> 04:30.460
where it used to be.

04:30.610 --> 04:32.280
It's basically the same as you left it.

04:32.280 --> 04:32.810
I've had someone come in

04:32.810 --> 04:34.010
to clean once a month.

04:35.050 --> 04:36.370
But the floor...

04:36.370 --> 04:38.720
The floor's just dirty

04:38.960 --> 04:40.820
because the movers tracked it in.

04:41.640 --> 04:42.050
Come.

04:46.690 --> 04:48.320
Take a look. Go inside.

04:53.930 --> 04:55.010
The fish tank...

04:55.010 --> 04:56.010
Where are my fish?

04:56.720 --> 04:57.490
The fish tank

04:57.490 --> 04:59.320
was cleaned pretty well.

04:59.320 --> 05:00.400
-Fish...
-Where are my fish?

05:00.400 --> 05:01.160
Fish...

05:01.450 --> 05:02.810
They're... They're

05:03.250 --> 05:04.760
at the sea and aquarium.

05:04.760 --> 05:05.960
They're doing great.

05:07.930 --> 05:09.930
Fish don't live as long as people do.

05:14.760 --> 05:15.280
Well.

05:27.050 --> 05:28.980
Eat less. It's bad for your health.

05:31.010 --> 05:31.520
Got it.

05:32.720 --> 05:34.120
Well...

05:34.280 --> 05:35.320
Eddie's come up with

05:35.320 --> 05:36.610
a few ideas for the exhibition.

05:36.610 --> 05:37.930
I'll take you to see the venue tomorrow.

05:37.930 --> 05:38.400
Okay?

05:39.320 --> 05:40.280
I'll...

05:40.280 --> 05:40.930
I'll go keep an eye on the paintings.

05:40.930 --> 05:42.080
Let's go. They are so careless.

05:42.080 --> 05:43.320
Hurry.

05:43.720 --> 05:44.130
Wait.

05:45.930 --> 05:46.490
Thanks.

05:48.200 --> 05:49.080
It's rare

05:49.370 --> 05:50.990
to hear "thanks" from you.

05:51.050 --> 05:53.050
I'll go keep an eye on the paintings.

05:54.159 --> 05:56.050
Sir, the corner...

06:18.760 --> 06:20.360
You didn't sleep well again?

06:29.570 --> 06:30.160
As for these plans,

06:30.160 --> 06:31.410
they are just frameworks for now.

06:31.410 --> 06:32.930
See if anything stands out to you.

06:32.930 --> 06:33.610
If so,

06:34.080 --> 06:36.340
Eddie's team will further develop them.

06:37.890 --> 06:38.890
Get some sleep first.

06:38.890 --> 06:41.290
We've still got a while
before we get there.

06:41.720 --> 06:44.580
We are going to
Pingchuan Exhibition Center first.

06:45.570 --> 06:46.370
I get

06:46.370 --> 06:48.090
why you wanted your first stop

06:48.250 --> 06:49.310
to be in Pingchuan.

06:51.610 --> 06:52.940
But let's agree on this.

06:52.960 --> 06:54.760
After that, let's have the professionals

06:54.760 --> 06:58.020
evaluate the best locations
for the rest of the tour, okay?

06:59.420 --> 07:06.240
[Class 1, Grade 12]

07:26.120 --> 07:28.370
[In Memory]

07:55.930 --> 07:57.730
Didn't you hear the school bell?

07:58.400 --> 07:59.400
Let me ask you all—

07:59.810 --> 08:00.690
what's the most important thing

08:00.690 --> 08:01.690
for you right now?

08:01.690 --> 08:03.760
The college entrance exam!

08:04.520 --> 08:06.130
The college entrance exam is
indeed important.

08:06.130 --> 08:08.010
But even more important
is learning to be a person

08:08.010 --> 08:09.450
of integrity and self-discipline.

08:09.450 --> 08:12.080
[In Memory]

08:16.520 --> 08:17.640
It's been 10 years.

08:19.080 --> 08:20.880
This place hasn't changed a bit.

08:23.760 --> 08:26.370
Yeah. They replaced the desks and chairs

08:25.040 --> 08:27.360
[In Memory]

08:27.130 --> 08:28.840
and added some smartboards,

08:27.970 --> 08:29.520
[In Memory of Our Beloved Teacher]

08:29.490 --> 08:32.090
but other than that,
it's pretty much the same.

08:33.039 --> 08:34.370
Look, even the curtains

08:34.400 --> 08:35.490
are the same color.

08:40.010 --> 08:42.570
[A Truly Wonderful Teacher]
[You Will Always Be Remembered]

08:54.400 --> 08:55.360
[In Memory of Our Beloved Teacher]

08:55.160 --> 08:56.010
It seems a lot of people

08:55.380 --> 08:56.460
[The Classroom Feels Empty Without You]
[Rest in Peace, Dear Teacher]

08:56.010 --> 08:57.330
still miss Ms. Zhang.

09:03.010 --> 09:06.350
[The Classroom Feels Empty Without You]
[Rest in Peace, Dear Teacher]

09:06.370 --> 09:10.270
[In Memory of Our Beloved Teacher]

09:45.460 --> 09:46.620
Mr. Bow.

09:47.440 --> 09:48.090
Zhou Wan?

09:49.520 --> 09:50.400
So it's you.

09:52.490 --> 09:54.550
To draw a mighty bow, full as the moon.

09:55.010 --> 09:56.540
So "Wan" means to draw a bow?

10:09.800 --> 10:10.820
Lu Xixiao,

10:11.640 --> 10:12.580
where are you

10:13.490 --> 10:14.490
right now?

10:16.090 --> 10:17.720
Do you still hate me as much?

10:26.680 --> 10:27.250
Zhou Wan.

10:45.040 --> 10:46.500
The holiday just started.

10:46.890 --> 10:48.160
There should still be quite a few teachers

10:48.160 --> 10:50.090
staying at school to wrap things up.

10:50.090 --> 10:51.220
I want to go see them.

10:52.730 --> 10:53.570
You go ahead.

10:54.440 --> 10:55.090
I already saw them

10:55.090 --> 10:56.130
at Ms. Zhang's funeral

10:56.130 --> 10:56.990
those two days.

10:59.680 --> 11:00.410
That's fine.

11:00.890 --> 11:03.490
It'd only be emotional
seeing everyone again.

11:04.040 --> 11:05.570
I'll just sit here for a bit.

11:05.800 --> 11:07.760
I'll walk around later.

11:08.850 --> 11:09.980
Let's meet up later.

11:10.560 --> 11:12.130
Okay, see you later.

11:28.280 --> 11:29.740
Stop the car! Stop the car!

11:29.920 --> 11:31.090
Pull over. Hurry.

11:39.280 --> 11:40.160
I already booked the convention center.

11:40.160 --> 11:41.130
Where are you going?

11:41.130 --> 11:42.560
Just passing by. Thought I'd take a look.

11:41.720 --> 11:42.350
[Yangming High School]

11:42.640 --> 11:44.240
We can't park here. Hurry up!

12:27.700 --> 12:29.770
♪ Dim gray ♪

12:30.900 --> 12:33.810
♪ Everything feels this way ♪

12:35.170 --> 12:38.040
♪ Another deserted place ♪

12:39.270 --> 12:41.000
♪ Swallowed by storm ♪

12:45.440 --> 12:47.030
♪ Hold my breath ♪

12:48.230 --> 12:51.060
♪ Run away from this mess ♪

12:52.240 --> 12:56.120
♪ Look to the light instead ♪

12:56.350 --> 12:58.490
♪ It's time to forget ♪

13:02.690 --> 13:07.190
♪ Broken pieces of our memories ♪

13:07.290 --> 13:08.930
♪ Stolen frozen ♪

13:09.140 --> 13:10.480
♪ In the river ♪

13:10.610 --> 13:12.480
♪ They're lost in a song ♪

13:13.280 --> 13:16.360
♪ Taken from where they belong ♪

13:20.230 --> 13:24.150
♪ Somewhere in this cold
and bottomless pit ♪

13:24.460 --> 13:26.510
♪ Something lingers ♪

13:26.620 --> 13:29.030
♪ Hiding under a stitch ♪

13:29.220 --> 13:31.440
♪ I thought I lost your remnant ♪

13:32.010 --> 13:34.580
♪ But it's ♪

13:36.070 --> 13:37.330
♪ Quiet as rain ♪

13:40.400 --> 13:42.540
♪ Deep as the ocean ♪

13:44.840 --> 13:48.430
♪ I feel it stir stir stir ♪

13:48.600 --> 13:51.510
♪ I still remember ♪

13:53.460 --> 13:55.440
♪ Shines like a star ♪

13:57.870 --> 14:00.340
♪ Glows like an ember ♪

14:02.090 --> 14:05.810
♪ Float like a curse curse curse ♪

14:06.120 --> 14:08.580
♪ Hurts like a sunburn ♪

14:51.700 --> 14:56.070
♪ Broken pieces of our memories ♪

14:56.300 --> 14:57.830
♪ Stolen frozen ♪

14:58.030 --> 14:59.230
♪ In the river ♪

14:59.390 --> 15:01.220
♪ They're lost in a song ♪

15:01.880 --> 15:05.310
♪ Taken from where they belong ♪

15:08.970 --> 15:12.860
♪ Stranded in this cold
and bottomless pit ♪

15:13.060 --> 15:15.040
♪ Makes me quiver ♪

15:15.400 --> 15:17.810
♪ Crimson spell of a witch ♪

15:18.030 --> 15:21.440
♪ I thought I'm over your magic ♪

15:21.540 --> 15:23.480
♪ But it's ♪

15:25.330 --> 15:26.760
♪ Quiet as rain ♪

15:29.660 --> 15:31.790
♪ Deep as the ocean ♪

15:33.890 --> 15:37.830
♪ I feel it stir stir stir ♪

15:37.960 --> 15:40.830
♪ I still remember ♪

15:42.600 --> 15:44.940
♪ Shines like a star ♪

15:47.160 --> 15:50.030
♪ Glows like an ember ♪

15:51.150 --> 15:55.010
♪ Float like a curse curse curse ♪

15:55.250 --> 15:57.850
♪ Hurts like a sunburn ♪

16:03.550 --> 16:05.220
♪ Breaking me killing me ♪

16:07.960 --> 16:10.600
♪ Burning me set me on fire ♪

16:12.580 --> 16:14.950
♪ You stick like a shadow of mine ♪

16:17.890 --> 16:18.850
Why are you here?

16:20.090 --> 16:21.250
No one's in the office,

16:21.250 --> 16:22.710
so I just wandered around.

16:22.890 --> 16:25.020
I've actually never been here before.

16:25.160 --> 16:26.220
It's quite unique.

16:26.920 --> 16:27.890
Let's go.

16:29.370 --> 16:30.830
-Let's go.
-Let's go back.

17:15.750 --> 17:16.460
Ms. Qilan.

17:22.400 --> 17:24.240
The resort project was launched

17:23.930 --> 17:27.430
[Lan Yue Group]

17:24.240 --> 17:26.300
by the Chairman himself 20 years ago.

17:26.369 --> 17:27.640
I secured the land

17:27.640 --> 17:29.160
for Phase I,

17:29.570 --> 17:30.570
and I've overseen

17:30.570 --> 17:32.090
the entire development.

17:32.090 --> 17:33.640
So I really don't understand

17:33.640 --> 17:34.680
why we suddenly need

17:34.680 --> 17:35.640
this unnecessary

17:35.640 --> 17:37.330
internal pitch competition.

17:37.430 --> 17:41.990
[Phase II Resort Project
Leadership Selection Meeting]

17:37.890 --> 17:39.400
Mr. Lu, you said it yourself.

17:39.400 --> 17:40.640
Phase I was

17:40.640 --> 17:42.090
20 years ago.

17:42.160 --> 17:43.400
Times have changed,

17:43.400 --> 17:44.440
and we can't keep

17:44.440 --> 17:45.640
clinging to the past.

17:46.480 --> 17:47.610
Lan Yue has set up multiple subsidiaries

17:47.610 --> 17:49.340
over the years

17:49.480 --> 17:51.340
and brought in a lot of new talent.

17:51.370 --> 17:52.480
It's time to let fresh ideas

17:52.480 --> 17:53.200
come in.

17:54.330 --> 17:56.770
Phase I resort alone

17:56.690 --> 17:57.100
[Lan Yue Group]

17:56.770 --> 17:58.640
has accounted for over 30%

17:57.100 --> 18:00.250
[Lan Yue Group Q3 Revenue Breakdown]

17:58.640 --> 18:00.440
of the company's profits over the years.

18:00.440 --> 18:02.640
That alone proves how successful it is.

18:03.000 --> 18:04.160
Are new ideas good?

18:04.330 --> 18:05.960
Of course they are.

18:05.960 --> 18:07.160
But handing a project of this scale

18:07.160 --> 18:08.550
over to subsidiaries

18:07.940 --> 18:14.850
[Lan Yue Group Q3 Revenue Breakdown]

18:08.640 --> 18:10.130
is too risky.

18:12.000 --> 18:13.720
All subsidiaries under Lan Yue

18:13.720 --> 18:15.370
will take part in an internal pitch.

18:15.370 --> 18:16.840
The winning company

18:16.920 --> 18:18.610
will form the Phase II project team,

18:18.610 --> 18:20.080
which will be placed
under the direct supervision

18:20.080 --> 18:21.570
of a headquarters-appointed project lead.

18:21.570 --> 18:23.400
This way, we can bring in fresh ideas

18:23.400 --> 18:25.400
while keeping risks under control.

18:25.920 --> 18:28.000
Mr. Lu, the resort project

18:28.000 --> 18:28.850
has been in your hands

18:28.850 --> 18:30.670
all these years.

18:31.050 --> 18:32.480
It's time to give everyone here

18:32.480 --> 18:33.410
a fair chance

18:33.440 --> 18:34.310
to compete.

18:38.240 --> 18:39.930
So after the competition,

18:40.130 --> 18:42.370
how will the head

18:40.400 --> 18:42.080
[Lan Yue Group Q3 Revenue Breakdown]

18:42.370 --> 18:43.630
of Phase II be decided?

18:43.640 --> 18:45.050
By the Board of Directors, of course.

18:45.050 --> 18:47.510
The full board
will make the final decision.

18:57.330 --> 18:59.130
I've been waiting 10 years
for this cup of tea

18:59.130 --> 19:00.680
from you, my boy.

19:01.090 --> 19:02.350
If you didn't come back soon,

19:02.350 --> 19:04.170
I'm afraid my old bones

19:04.290 --> 19:05.530
would be in the grave.

19:05.920 --> 19:07.200
Don't fool me.

19:07.720 --> 19:09.660
I asked around before I came back.

19:10.330 --> 19:11.890
I heard you're in great shape

19:11.890 --> 19:12.940
these days.

19:13.640 --> 19:15.400
Who exactly told you that?

19:15.850 --> 19:17.610
I take more pills in a day

19:18.000 --> 19:19.370
than I do meals.

19:19.810 --> 19:20.570
Really?

19:21.200 --> 19:23.290
Then I guess all those supplements

19:23.290 --> 19:24.360
I brought you

19:24.680 --> 19:25.920
will just go to waste.

19:26.330 --> 19:27.660
I'd better have someone take them back.

19:27.660 --> 19:29.160
That won't do.

19:29.850 --> 19:31.530
You can't take back what you gave.

19:31.530 --> 19:32.390
Come, sit down.

19:40.440 --> 19:41.160
How is it?

19:41.770 --> 19:42.850
How long are you planning to stay

19:42.850 --> 19:44.240
this time?

19:46.370 --> 19:47.570
I'm here

19:47.640 --> 19:48.720
for an exhibition,

19:48.810 --> 19:50.470
so I'll probably stay a while.

19:51.290 --> 19:53.150
You don't plan to return for good?

20:01.000 --> 20:02.260
I really didn't expect

20:02.370 --> 20:04.170
you'd end up choosing painting.

20:05.000 --> 20:05.960
You asked me to study economics,

20:05.960 --> 20:07.090
and I did, didn't I?

20:07.400 --> 20:09.610
You studied it but won't come back
to help the family business.

20:09.610 --> 20:11.050
What's the point

20:11.330 --> 20:12.730
of that master's degree?

20:14.960 --> 20:16.560
What's wrong with painting?

20:17.290 --> 20:19.490
My paintbrush won't turn its back on me.

20:23.400 --> 20:24.570
Alright, old man.

20:24.890 --> 20:26.050
You were the one who told me

20:26.050 --> 20:27.160
to choose for myself.

20:27.160 --> 20:28.090
You can't go back on your word

20:28.090 --> 20:29.610
just because you're getting older.

20:29.610 --> 20:30.810
Good thing I brought you

20:30.810 --> 20:31.370
a painting.

20:31.370 --> 20:32.810
If you don't want it,
I'll have someone take it back...

20:32.810 --> 20:33.530
Come back!

20:34.200 --> 20:35.290
You brat.

20:35.530 --> 20:36.850
Are you bullying me?

20:36.850 --> 20:37.330
Are you?

20:37.810 --> 20:39.010
You know I love you.

20:39.030 --> 20:39.920
How could I?

20:43.400 --> 20:44.090
Okay.

20:44.090 --> 20:45.550
I'm just glad you're back.

20:48.290 --> 20:49.050
Yes, Boss.

20:49.050 --> 20:49.920
Okay.

20:50.160 --> 20:51.530
Definitely.

20:51.530 --> 20:52.720
We'll keep up the good work.

20:52.720 --> 20:53.640
Take care.

20:54.370 --> 20:55.480
Okay.

21:02.850 --> 21:03.480
Okay.

21:05.920 --> 21:07.530
Back at Wantuo,

21:07.610 --> 21:09.370
he was the one who filed a report
to get you fired.

21:09.370 --> 21:10.330
And now he's

21:10.330 --> 21:11.200
taken your report

21:11.200 --> 21:12.720
and used it to claim credit.

21:12.720 --> 21:13.200
Ms. Zhou Wan,

21:13.200 --> 21:15.200
stop being so easygoing about this.

21:15.680 --> 21:17.050
I'll still get my overtime pay

21:17.050 --> 21:18.400
and my bonus.

21:18.960 --> 21:19.890
Getting angry at him

21:19.890 --> 21:21.480
is just wasting my time.

21:21.920 --> 21:23.160
But given your abilities,

21:23.160 --> 21:25.400
you should've been promoted
a long time ago.

21:25.400 --> 21:26.960
And knowing him,

21:27.160 --> 21:30.200
there's no guarantee
he'll even pass the bonus down to us.

21:30.200 --> 21:32.740
Alright, everyone.

21:32.920 --> 21:33.850
Next, I've got some good news

21:33.850 --> 21:35.370
to announce.

21:36.130 --> 21:37.890
The bonus for our Wantuo project

21:37.890 --> 21:39.240
has been issued.

21:39.330 --> 21:41.920
Everyone gets a share!

21:42.200 --> 21:43.090
[Applause]

21:43.770 --> 21:44.430
[Cheering]

21:48.240 --> 21:49.090
But,

21:49.960 --> 21:51.370
don't get

21:51.370 --> 21:52.530
too carried away.

21:52.640 --> 21:53.400
Because

21:53.400 --> 21:54.460
next week,

21:54.680 --> 21:56.570
the pitch for Phase II

21:56.570 --> 21:57.850
of the Lan Yue Resort
Architect project

21:57.850 --> 21:59.000
is about to start.

21:58.770 --> 21:59.800
[Phase II of Lan Yue Resort
Architect project]

21:59.000 --> 22:00.610
So the second piece of good news is—

21:59.820 --> 22:01.510
[Concept Design
and Architectural Proposal]

22:00.810 --> 22:02.480
starting today,

22:02.480 --> 22:04.640
we're all working overtime.

22:07.610 --> 22:08.530
I told you.

22:33.720 --> 22:34.960
Hello. Who is it?

22:35.770 --> 22:37.230
What's with the attitude?

22:40.240 --> 22:41.430
Sorry, Auntie.

22:41.570 --> 22:43.400
I didn't check the caller ID.

22:44.290 --> 22:45.610
You ungrateful brat.

22:45.610 --> 22:48.140
You come back
and don't even bother to call me?

22:48.810 --> 22:50.440
I knew you were busy.

22:51.530 --> 22:52.590
I'm free tomorrow.

22:52.680 --> 22:53.680
Let's grab a meal.

22:55.570 --> 22:56.680
With the situation so tense,

22:56.680 --> 22:59.010
you still have time
to ask me out for a meal?

22:59.400 --> 23:00.930
It's not that simple, is it?

23:01.720 --> 23:03.130
Look at you.

23:03.130 --> 23:04.000
You're not even in the country,

23:04.000 --> 23:05.400
but you know everything.

23:08.240 --> 23:08.810
Auntie,

23:09.480 --> 23:10.240
I know that over these years,

23:10.240 --> 23:12.810
it's only you and Grandpa
who have always cared about me,

23:12.810 --> 23:14.670
and I'm very grateful to you both.

23:15.370 --> 23:16.160
But,

23:19.850 --> 23:20.890
this Lan Yue matter—

23:20.890 --> 23:21.440
I really

23:21.470 --> 23:23.600
don't want to get involved in it at all.

23:26.680 --> 23:27.540
Maybe this way—

23:28.530 --> 23:30.370
when I have time
in the next couple of days,

23:30.370 --> 23:31.570
if you really miss me,

23:31.640 --> 23:32.480
I can come over

23:32.680 --> 23:34.850
and we can have a meal together.
Is that okay?

23:34.850 --> 23:35.680
Okay.

23:35.680 --> 23:37.770
Alright, alright. Our Xixiao has grown up—

23:37.770 --> 23:38.570
now you're already playing
the "preemptive strike"

23:38.570 --> 23:39.920
on me.

23:40.370 --> 23:41.440
Since you've blocked everything

23:41.440 --> 23:42.160
I was going to say,

23:42.160 --> 23:43.560
I won't force it anymore.

23:43.680 --> 23:44.770
Pick a day when you're free

23:44.770 --> 23:45.810
and come have a meal

23:45.810 --> 23:46.890
with your grandpa with me.

23:46.890 --> 23:49.290
Okay.

23:53.480 --> 23:54.480
Why is it you?

23:54.520 --> 23:55.370
Don't you have a key?

23:55.370 --> 23:56.610
Why did you ring the doorbell?

23:56.610 --> 23:58.810
I rang it for ages but you didn't answer.

23:59.960 --> 24:01.290
What are you doing here?

24:02.050 --> 24:03.200
I'm here to coordinate
all the arrangements

24:03.200 --> 24:04.640
for the exhibition.

24:04.810 --> 24:05.530
I'm planning to move in

24:05.530 --> 24:06.860
and work alongside you.

24:07.330 --> 24:08.400
Speak normally.

24:09.850 --> 24:10.530
Fine.

24:10.950 --> 24:12.330
I'm moving in to supervise you

24:12.330 --> 24:13.530
so you can finish the paintings

24:13.530 --> 24:14.930
you've been putting off.

24:15.720 --> 24:16.290
Get out.

24:16.330 --> 24:17.530
Don't, don't, don't.

24:17.920 --> 24:18.980
To be honest,

24:19.400 --> 24:20.850
my marriage is falling apart.

24:20.850 --> 24:21.980
I have nowhere to go.

24:23.640 --> 24:24.240
Really.

24:24.890 --> 24:26.150
This time I'm serious.

24:38.090 --> 24:39.150
Say it—welcome me.

24:41.000 --> 24:41.640
Welcome.

24:43.740 --> 24:44.530
Welcome.

24:57.610 --> 24:58.440
I just want to know

24:58.440 --> 24:59.240
what happened.

24:59.240 --> 25:00.290
The problem is—

25:01.240 --> 25:02.500
I still don't know why.

25:03.680 --> 25:04.480
Bro,

25:05.850 --> 25:07.450
you were together for 7 years

25:07.640 --> 25:09.050
and have been married for 3.

25:09.050 --> 25:10.370
And you still don't know why?

25:10.370 --> 25:11.400
No cheating,

25:11.640 --> 25:12.810
and no fighting.

25:13.160 --> 25:14.290
I really don't know.

25:15.290 --> 25:16.350
Nothing happened?

25:16.440 --> 25:17.610
Yes.

25:19.290 --> 25:20.490
No affection either?

25:20.570 --> 25:21.680
And no love?

25:22.050 --> 25:23.130
Nothing happened?

25:23.920 --> 25:25.720
So you two are getting a divorce?

25:26.960 --> 25:28.720
If it weren't for the cooling-off period,

25:28.720 --> 25:30.450
I'd already be divorced today!

25:31.810 --> 25:32.810
You brought it up?

25:33.610 --> 25:34.480
Why?

25:35.480 --> 25:36.200
Why?

25:38.200 --> 25:39.200
I guess I'm tired.

25:41.090 --> 25:42.050
Tired!

25:45.330 --> 25:46.370
Is it because I didn't
put the toilet seat down

25:46.370 --> 25:47.240
after using the bathroom?

25:47.240 --> 25:48.400
Or because I didn't hang up her laundry

25:48.400 --> 25:49.440
after she washed it?

25:49.440 --> 25:51.000
Or because when she called me

25:51.000 --> 25:52.720
during a work meeting,
I didn't answer her?

25:52.720 --> 25:54.240
It can't be that.

25:55.610 --> 25:56.640
Gu Meng's personality shouldn't

25:56.640 --> 25:58.700
make her upset over things like that.

25:59.810 --> 26:01.050
Is it because it was her birthday

26:01.050 --> 26:01.770
recently,

26:02.130 --> 26:03.240
and I was overseas

26:03.400 --> 26:05.660
helping you negotiate with collectors?

26:06.160 --> 26:07.000
No, that doesn't fit either.

26:07.000 --> 26:08.640
I bought her a birthday gift,

26:08.640 --> 26:10.920
and I even made up
for missing her birthday.

26:10.920 --> 26:12.050
For my birthday,

26:12.680 --> 26:13.850
I told him I wanted

26:13.850 --> 26:15.850
a certain brand of scented candles.

26:16.200 --> 26:17.200
And what did I get?

26:17.330 --> 26:19.160
A fire extinguisher—

26:19.290 --> 26:20.330
he said my temper is too hot

26:20.330 --> 26:21.610
and I needed to be "put out."

26:21.610 --> 26:24.340
He even said it was a custom-made
scented candle.

26:24.400 --> 26:26.130
I... I was giving him
the silent treatment,

26:26.130 --> 26:28.260
and practically suffocating from it.

26:28.290 --> 26:29.240
He covered the room

26:29.240 --> 26:30.330
with knockoff prints

26:30.330 --> 26:31.440
he found online,

26:31.440 --> 26:33.970
saying we should
play "spot the difference,"

26:35.810 --> 26:36.720
like nothing

26:36.720 --> 26:37.850
had ever happened.

26:38.640 --> 26:40.130
Is he out of his mind?

26:40.130 --> 26:42.460
He is out of his mind!

26:43.810 --> 26:45.810
But it's also kind of his style.

26:46.200 --> 26:48.460
Most people wouldn't even think of that.

26:54.680 --> 26:56.020
I just feel...

26:56.240 --> 26:58.090
I can ignore all of this.

27:00.130 --> 27:01.570
But what I really want is—

27:02.200 --> 27:03.330
when I need him the most,

27:03.330 --> 27:04.920
the absolute most,

27:05.160 --> 27:06.370
the person I care about

27:06.370 --> 27:08.200
can be right there with me.

27:09.090 --> 27:11.350
Is that really such a difficult request?

27:11.530 --> 27:12.370
No, it's not.

27:12.610 --> 27:13.440
Not at all.

27:17.640 --> 27:19.300
Maybe a little bit difficult.

27:20.130 --> 27:20.920
Meng,

27:21.610 --> 27:22.430
in this life,

27:22.460 --> 27:23.990
we will meet a lot of people.

27:24.200 --> 27:25.680
No one can guarantee that

27:25.920 --> 27:27.180
the person beside you

27:27.810 --> 27:30.290
will always be the most important person
in your life.

27:30.290 --> 27:31.440
You'll meet a lot of

27:31.440 --> 27:32.970
other people in the future.

27:33.480 --> 27:36.670
But if I say I get off work exhausted,

27:37.130 --> 27:38.650
or I have something happy

27:38.770 --> 27:39.850
I want to share,

27:40.640 --> 27:42.720
or something sad I want to cry about—

27:42.920 --> 27:45.290
he's never there.

27:46.640 --> 27:48.290
He can't even

27:48.290 --> 27:49.890
understand what's bothering me.

27:49.890 --> 27:50.960
He doesn't understand

27:50.960 --> 27:52.290
that I need care.

27:52.960 --> 27:54.050
I just don't know

27:55.440 --> 27:56.680
what this person

27:56.680 --> 27:57.680
means to me.

28:02.850 --> 28:04.810
Don't put up with it if you don't want to.

28:04.810 --> 28:06.810
If it means nothing to you, let it go.

28:06.960 --> 28:08.850
Cry if you want to. It's okay.

28:11.130 --> 28:11.920
Wan,

28:13.770 --> 28:14.690
do you think

28:14.710 --> 28:16.570
there's something wrong with me?

28:16.960 --> 28:17.810
Back then,

28:18.530 --> 28:19.950
my whole family didn't approve of me

28:19.950 --> 28:20.610
being with Jiang Fan—

28:20.610 --> 28:21.680
he was

28:21.680 --> 28:23.010
such an unreliable man.

28:24.610 --> 28:25.480
But now,

28:26.770 --> 28:28.260
everyone thinks

28:28.640 --> 28:30.370
he's successful in his career,

28:30.570 --> 28:31.920
that he's ambitious.

28:33.530 --> 28:34.640
But why do I

28:36.330 --> 28:37.530
miss the version of him from before,

28:37.530 --> 28:39.130
when his eyes were only on me?

28:49.920 --> 28:50.400
Don't you two still

28:50.400 --> 28:51.860
have a marital apartment?

28:52.530 --> 28:53.660
You mean that house?

28:54.680 --> 28:55.890
She didn't want us

28:56.680 --> 28:58.540
to use my parents' money to buy it.

28:59.130 --> 29:01.370
We saved up
for the down payment ourselves,

29:01.370 --> 29:03.090
planned to pay off the mortgage
little by little,

29:03.090 --> 29:05.330
and furnish it together over time.

29:05.530 --> 29:06.130
And then what?

29:06.130 --> 29:08.440
Later we both got busier and busier.

29:09.200 --> 29:09.890
It's still empty

29:09.890 --> 29:10.890
to this day.

29:11.130 --> 29:12.320
Okay, you guys go ahead.

29:12.320 --> 29:13.330
I'll be back in half an hour.

29:13.330 --> 29:13.920
Okay?

29:14.640 --> 29:15.000
What's wrong?

29:15.000 --> 29:15.960
Why did you call me over in such a rush?

29:15.960 --> 29:16.770
I'm setting up an exhibition there.

29:16.770 --> 29:17.960
I've already signed it.

29:17.960 --> 29:19.570
If you're okay with it,

29:19.570 --> 29:20.110
come with me

29:20.110 --> 29:22.040
to the civil affairs bureau later.

29:23.180 --> 29:23.620
[Divorce Agreement]

29:23.930 --> 29:26.400
[Female: Gu Meng]

29:28.680 --> 29:29.530
Seriously?

29:29.530 --> 29:31.640
-I'm just busy these days.
-I've already contacted a realtor.

29:31.640 --> 29:33.100
The house has been listed.

29:33.160 --> 29:34.340
The division of assets

29:34.340 --> 29:35.610
has already been written
into the agreement.

29:35.610 --> 29:36.610
Once the money comes in,

29:36.610 --> 29:38.480
I'll transfer it to you immediately.

29:38.480 --> 29:39.810
Are you serious, honey?

29:41.090 --> 29:41.960
Take a look.

29:42.890 --> 29:44.350
I'll wait for you outside.

29:49.130 --> 29:50.860
That place isn't fit to live in,

29:50.920 --> 29:52.160
and I can't go home either—

29:52.160 --> 29:54.220
my parents can't find out about this.

29:54.370 --> 29:55.240
So

29:56.530 --> 29:58.000
just take me in for a while,

29:58.480 --> 29:59.050
okay?

29:59.240 --> 30:00.710
I promise I'll be a

30:00.890 --> 30:02.020
very good roommate.

30:06.570 --> 30:07.850
Then you're in charge of

30:07.850 --> 30:09.400
feeding Xiaoliu while you're here.

30:09.400 --> 30:11.640
No problem. Leave it all to me.

30:14.370 --> 30:15.160
Okay.

30:16.290 --> 30:17.530
Go easy on the drinks.

30:18.000 --> 30:19.600
I'm walking him again today.

30:20.290 --> 30:21.640
My place doesn't take in alcoholics.

30:21.640 --> 30:22.700
I'm telling you...

30:23.240 --> 30:23.810
Let's go, Xiaoliu.

30:23.810 --> 30:25.610
As if you've ever gone
a day without drinking.

30:25.610 --> 30:26.140
Let's go.

30:26.370 --> 30:28.160
The cooling-off period
for divorce is one month.

30:28.160 --> 30:28.720
Take this month

30:28.720 --> 30:29.810
to think about what you want to do.

30:29.810 --> 30:31.810
I won't care about you after a month.

30:37.050 --> 30:38.180
It's all your fault.

30:38.240 --> 30:40.400
I was fine, but you made me cry.

30:41.610 --> 30:43.920
Okay, okay, it's my fault.

30:44.160 --> 30:45.390
Meng.

30:46.920 --> 30:48.000
All right.

30:48.920 --> 30:50.130
Go wash up properly

30:50.130 --> 30:51.530
and get some sleep, okay?

30:51.610 --> 30:53.200
Maybe when you wake up tomorrow,

30:53.200 --> 30:54.480
you won't feel as sad.

30:56.000 --> 30:57.890
But I didn't bring any toiletries.

30:57.890 --> 30:58.370
What should I do?

30:58.370 --> 30:59.610
It's fine. Use mine.

30:59.960 --> 31:01.240
I'll go to the convenience store nearby

31:01.240 --> 31:02.440
and buy you some more.

31:03.240 --> 31:04.050
Okay.

31:07.680 --> 31:08.370
Good girl.

31:09.190 --> 31:09.990
Hey, Eddie.

31:10.640 --> 31:12.770
I just finished looking at your draft.

31:12.770 --> 31:13.830
Looks pretty good.

31:14.290 --> 31:16.570
I might want to make some minor changes

31:16.570 --> 31:17.850
towards the coloring.

31:18.480 --> 31:18.900
Don't worry.

31:18.900 --> 31:19.440
I've sent it

31:19.440 --> 31:20.240
to your email.

31:20.400 --> 31:21.570
And

31:23.000 --> 31:24.400
take a look when you can.

31:30.510 --> 31:32.950
[Crazy Fire! Destroy all!]

31:35.810 --> 31:37.050
Go.

31:51.050 --> 31:52.530
Hello, how can I help you?

31:53.270 --> 31:57.660
[Crazy Fire! Destroy all!]

31:53.680 --> 31:55.680
Where did you get this game console?

31:56.290 --> 31:57.530
There used to be an arcade nearby.

31:57.530 --> 31:58.390
It closed down.

31:58.570 --> 31:59.770
Our boss has always liked

31:59.770 --> 32:01.200
this kind of retro stuff;

32:01.480 --> 32:02.810
he thought it'd be a waste
to throw it away,

32:02.810 --> 32:04.740
so he bought it back as decoration.

32:06.000 --> 32:07.200
The one at the market?

32:07.440 --> 32:07.920
Yes.

32:11.330 --> 32:12.720
Let me take a look.

32:13.240 --> 32:13.770
Sure.

32:13.960 --> 32:14.770
Thanks.

32:28.110 --> 32:30.290
[Game Leaderboard]

32:33.720 --> 32:34.530
Just because you don't need to study

32:34.530 --> 32:36.090
doesn't mean other people don't have to.

32:36.090 --> 32:37.950
I'm preparing to retake the exam.

32:38.200 --> 32:38.850
For you.

32:39.720 --> 32:41.120
It really looks like you.

32:41.160 --> 32:41.890
Kobito is too ugly.

32:41.890 --> 32:43.440
-What are you doing?
-It doesn't look like me at all.

32:43.440 --> 32:45.160
How can you say you're ugly?

32:45.160 --> 32:46.610
I don't allow you to
talk about yourself like that.

32:46.610 --> 32:48.090
Look at it;
is it like looking in a mirror?

32:48.090 --> 32:49.480
I'm Zhou Wan.

32:49.480 --> 32:50.240
What?

32:50.240 --> 32:51.440
It's for you. Take it.

33:08.050 --> 33:09.820
Can I pet you?

33:11.570 --> 33:13.160
You smell so good.

33:14.050 --> 33:15.750
Did you just take a bath?

33:16.260 --> 33:18.210
♪ Infinite descent ♪

33:17.370 --> 33:18.640
What's your name?

33:18.690 --> 33:19.820
Can you shake hands?

33:19.920 --> 33:21.290
Shake hands.

33:20.030 --> 33:22.170
♪ Gradually sinking ♪

33:22.090 --> 33:23.890
You can shake hands!

33:23.690 --> 33:25.790
♪ The bubbles I once held tightly ♪

33:27.320 --> 33:29.540
♪ Cannot hold onto this flicker ♪

33:28.240 --> 33:29.890
Can we take a photo together?

33:29.890 --> 33:30.770
Can we?

33:31.300 --> 33:33.020
♪ Nothing to do with love or fate ♪

33:31.610 --> 33:33.280
Can I take a photo with you?

33:34.550 --> 33:36.970
♪ Ending without a cause ♪

33:38.330 --> 33:40.300
♪ The unease once touched ♪

33:39.440 --> 33:41.090
You are so cute.

33:41.970 --> 33:44.890
♪ Smooths out the wrinkles of the heart ♪

33:47.430 --> 33:50.650
♪ Even if you remove the rooted mask ♪

33:51.670 --> 33:54.240
♪ Let joy and sorrow be laid bare ♪

33:53.610 --> 33:55.170
I used to have a dog too.

33:55.270 --> 33:57.740
♪ Still cannot hide the shadow behind ♪

33:56.130 --> 33:57.900
It should be about your age now.

33:58.970 --> 34:01.260
♪ Hysterical collapse ♪

34:01.090 --> 34:02.160
I don't know if it's as pretty

34:02.160 --> 34:04.880
or as strong as you.

34:02.430 --> 34:04.990
♪ If meeting means destined separation ♪

34:05.970 --> 34:08.929
♪ Then it is an addiction
life cannot bear ♪

34:07.290 --> 34:08.020
Shake hands.

34:08.920 --> 34:09.920
So smart.

34:10.250 --> 34:12.400
♪ Let me fail,
or bloom until the flower fades ♪

34:10.730 --> 34:11.730
You have a dog too?

34:13.719 --> 34:16.139
♪ That's all it is ♪

34:17.239 --> 34:20.090
♪ When, where, has it ever appeared ♪

34:20.270 --> 34:23.989
♪ A world without ignorance,
without desire, without end ♪

34:20.290 --> 34:21.690
Its name is Zhou Xiaoliu.

34:24.100 --> 34:27.429
♪ I come, I go, I stay,
yet I am not myself ♪

34:24.850 --> 34:25.889
I raised it

34:25.889 --> 34:27.210
with a girl

34:27.210 --> 34:28.080
I once loved very much.

34:27.659 --> 34:31.409
♪ As if in madness, as if in a dream,
arriving as promised ♪

34:31.400 --> 34:32.929
But she abandoned it later.

34:36.080 --> 34:37.400
I even told her—

34:40.690 --> 34:41.460
don't let me

34:41.480 --> 34:43.480
ever see you again in this lifetime,

34:44.690 --> 34:45.400
or I'll make you

34:45.400 --> 34:46.290
cry and beg me.

34:51.480 --> 34:52.120
Do you think she would

34:52.120 --> 34:53.210
still dare face me?

34:53.290 --> 34:54.840
♪ Infinite descent ♪

34:56.560 --> 34:58.650
♪ Gradually sinking ♪

35:00.170 --> 35:02.100
♪ The bubbles I once held tightly ♪

35:03.620 --> 35:05.840
♪ Cannot hold onto this flicker ♪

35:07.570 --> 35:09.270
♪ Nothing to do with love or fate ♪

35:10.890 --> 35:13.210
♪ Ending without a cause ♪

35:14.550 --> 35:16.590
♪ The unease once touched ♪

35:18.360 --> 35:21.230
♪ Smooths out the wrinkles of the heart ♪

35:19.170 --> 35:20.100
Long time no see.

35:23.770 --> 35:26.840
♪ Even if you remove the rooted mask ♪

35:27.250 --> 35:28.120
I'm fine.

35:27.760 --> 35:30.310
♪ Let joy and sorrow be laid bare ♪

35:29.300 --> 35:30.190
I didn't cry.

35:31.510 --> 35:33.980
♪ Still cannot hide the shadow behind ♪

35:31.850 --> 35:33.170
I was just passing by.

35:35.090 --> 35:37.700
♪ Hysterical collapse ♪

35:35.890 --> 35:37.550
I have forgotten many things.

35:38.360 --> 35:39.760
You should forget them soon too.

35:38.910 --> 35:41.240
♪ If meeting means destined separation ♪

35:42.450 --> 35:45.200
♪ Then it is an addiction
life cannot bear ♪

35:46.480 --> 35:48.760
♪ Let me fail,
or bloom until the flower fades ♪

35:49.850 --> 35:52.310
♪ That's all it is ♪

35:53.230 --> 35:56.310
♪ When, where, has it ever appeared ♪

35:56.480 --> 36:00.000
♪ A world without ignorance,
without desire, without end ♪

36:00.220 --> 36:03.660
♪ I come, I go, I stay,
yet I am not myself ♪

36:03.890 --> 36:07.840
♪ As if in madness, as if in a dream,
arriving as promised ♪

37:25.860 --> 37:27.930
♪ Dim gray ♪

37:29.070 --> 37:31.980
♪ Everything feels this way ♪

37:33.330 --> 37:36.420
♪ Another deserted place ♪

37:37.430 --> 37:39.100
♪ Swallowed by storm ♪

37:43.610 --> 37:45.200
♪ Hold my breath ♪

37:46.390 --> 37:49.220
♪ Run away from this mess ♪

37:50.800 --> 37:54.280
♪ Look to the light instead ♪

37:54.510 --> 37:56.650
♪ It's time to forget ♪

38:00.850 --> 38:05.350
♪ Broken pieces of our memories ♪

38:05.440 --> 38:06.900
♪ Stolen frozen ♪

38:07.300 --> 38:08.460
♪ In the river ♪

38:08.590 --> 38:10.310
♪ They're lost in a song ♪

38:11.440 --> 38:14.520
♪ Taken from where they belong ♪

38:18.510 --> 38:22.310
♪ Somewhere in this cold
and bottomless pit ♪

38:22.620 --> 38:24.780
♪ Something lingers ♪

38:24.890 --> 38:27.190
♪ Hiding under a stitch ♪

38:27.390 --> 38:30.520
♪ I thought I lost your remnant ♪

38:30.680 --> 38:32.560
♪ But it's ♪

38:36.000 --> 38:37.520
Did an earthquake really happen

38:37.520 --> 38:40.110
after I fell asleep yesterday?

38:59.170 --> 39:00.080
Did you know all along

39:00.080 --> 39:02.140
that Zhou Wan returned to Pingchuan?

39:09.480 --> 39:11.810
I only heard about it later from Gu Meng.

39:13.560 --> 39:14.480
And back then

39:14.480 --> 39:16.000
when you went abroad like that…

39:16.000 --> 39:18.730
Things are finally fine now, right?

39:19.170 --> 39:20.440
Everyone is doing pretty well.

39:20.440 --> 39:22.900
I didn't think there was
a need to bring it up.

39:44.920 --> 39:46.040
Smells so good.

39:46.850 --> 39:48.440
Who's cooking?

39:52.560 --> 39:54.440
Long time no see!

39:54.440 --> 39:55.290
Did you miss me?

39:55.290 --> 39:56.040
Did you miss me?

39:56.040 --> 39:56.960
I did.

39:56.960 --> 39:58.220
I couldn't tell at all.

39:58.330 --> 39:59.120
You were beating around the bush

39:59.120 --> 40:00.580
on the phone the other day.

40:03.520 --> 40:04.520
So what made you think of inviting me

40:04.520 --> 40:05.620
to dinner today—

40:05.770 --> 40:06.920
and even cooking yourself?

40:06.920 --> 40:07.780
So thoughtful.

40:12.250 --> 40:13.380
Why did you lie to me?

40:18.600 --> 40:19.460
About Zhou Wan.

40:23.920 --> 40:25.480
So this was an ambush banquet after all.

40:25.480 --> 40:27.610
You brought me here to interrogate me.

40:38.170 --> 40:39.250
If I hadn't told you

40:39.250 --> 40:41.770
that Zhou Wan had completely
disappeared from Pingchuan,

40:41.770 --> 40:44.250
would you have been able to
leave the country in peace?

40:44.250 --> 40:45.330
If I had told you

40:45.330 --> 40:47.690
she came back to Pingchuan
after graduation,

40:47.690 --> 40:48.440
would you have been able to

40:48.440 --> 40:49.640
stay abroad in peace?

40:51.180 --> 40:52.170
You know the situation with Lan Yue

40:52.170 --> 40:53.040
very well.

40:53.040 --> 40:53.560
Personally, of course

40:53.560 --> 40:55.360
I want you to stay in the country.

40:55.440 --> 40:56.000
Was I hiding it

40:56.000 --> 40:57.370
just for myself?

40:59.370 --> 41:00.810
I know you care about me.

41:02.080 --> 41:02.670
Over all these years,

41:02.670 --> 41:03.920
only you and Grandpa have treated me well.

41:03.920 --> 41:04.770
I know that.

41:05.440 --> 41:07.730
Since you know,
then don't look back anymore.

41:07.730 --> 41:08.280
You're not

41:08.280 --> 41:09.480
that kid anymore.

41:09.480 --> 41:10.250
Zhou Wan isn't the same Zhou Wan

41:10.250 --> 41:11.650
from 10 years ago either.

41:11.690 --> 41:13.260
Getting tangled up again

41:13.290 --> 41:14.290
won't do any good.

41:15.070 --> 41:16.290
I know that too.

41:18.890 --> 41:19.470
But in the past couple of days

41:19.470 --> 41:20.870
I figured something out.

41:22.650 --> 41:23.890
I never really

41:25.440 --> 41:25.990
let it go

41:26.020 --> 41:27.060
all these years.

41:29.080 --> 41:31.170
I might as well keep getting tangled up

41:31.170 --> 41:32.830
until I finally get sick of it.

41:41.040 --> 41:42.780
Alright, after all these years,

41:42.780 --> 41:44.240
you haven't changed a bit.

41:49.210 --> 41:50.610
Take a look at this first.

41:54.560 --> 41:55.580
Our company's

41:55.600 --> 41:56.810
biggest current project

41:56.810 --> 41:58.330
is Phase II of the resort.

41:59.120 --> 42:01.140
The pitch meeting is next week.

42:01.290 --> 42:02.290
Five subsidiaries

42:02.290 --> 42:03.600
are participating in the first round.

42:03.600 --> 42:04.630
Lu Zhongyue and I

42:04.650 --> 42:06.710
each have our preferred candidates.

42:06.850 --> 42:07.920
But if

42:08.080 --> 42:10.000
the winner turns out to be his side,

42:10.000 --> 42:11.660
then it'll be difficult for me

42:12.080 --> 42:13.370
to compete for

42:13.400 --> 42:14.860
the Phase II project lead.

42:15.400 --> 42:16.440
This document in your hands

42:16.440 --> 42:18.100
is something I managed to get.

42:18.480 --> 42:19.170
It's

42:19.200 --> 42:20.520
the planning team list

42:20.560 --> 42:21.650
of our biggest competitor,

42:21.650 --> 42:22.910
Boxing Construction.

42:24.330 --> 42:25.730
This proposal is not bad.

42:26.650 --> 42:28.370
What does this have to do with me?

42:28.370 --> 42:30.630
I'm not interested in Lan Yue's affairs.

42:31.690 --> 42:32.690
Keep reading.

42:34.960 --> 42:35.810
Keep reading?

42:44.500 --> 42:46.140
[Zhou Wan—Boxing Construction
—core member, proposal presenter]

42:51.260 --> 42:53.590
Does it really have nothing
to do with you?

43:01.350 --> 43:05.530
[Zhou Wan—Boxing Construction
—core member, proposal presenter]
